WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.230
- The former district attorney

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.540
in the Ahmaud Arbery case

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.510
has been indicted on
a count of obstruction

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:06.200
and a violation of her oath.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.730
I really didn't see this one coming.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.600
This all relates to
ways that she allegedly

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.530
mishandled the case of Ahmaud Arbery,

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.900
who was pursued in
gunned down while jogging

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.550
through the Atlanta suburb.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.310
The former district
attorney actually recused

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.450
herself early on because one

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.860
of the alleged gunman

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.930
was a former government employee.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:22.920
And charges were only brought

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.620
by the Georgia Attorney General

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.680
two months later after cell phone footage

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:27.513
of the shooting

00:00:27.513 --> 00:00:28.370
was released to the public.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.980
The indictment says
that former D.A. Johnson

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.840
violated her oath by not disclosing

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.720
that she had tried to
appoint D.A. Barnhill

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.240
to the case after she recused herself.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:36.210
When she recommended

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.480
that Barnhill be appointed

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.890
by the Attorney General.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:40.560
An indictment also
states that she knowingly

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.650
and directed two police
officers not to arrest

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.850
the alleged gunman,

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.460
which apparently gives rise

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.970
to a potential obstruction charge.

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.370
This is absolutely wild and comes

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:49.203
out of left field,

00:00:49.203 --> 00:00:50.753
so we'll see everyone in court.

